! WASM_USERMODELS WM.3 — Generator GenModel=6 DYNAMICS gate, with a ShaftModel.
! Same base circuit as wasm_gen_pflow; after the snapshot solve the induction
! machine runs a short dynamics sequence. Two monitors exercise the dynamics
! plumbing: `mode=1` (V and I) and `mode=3` (the element state-variable surface,
! sampled each step via GetAllVariables). ShaftModel=@FIXTURE@ / ShaftData
! exercise the Generator shaft call sites (FInit / FIntegrate / FCalc — Pascal
! generator.pas:2451/2536/2038). The `@FIXTURE@` token is substituted with the
! native `.dll` twin (r4133 oracle) or the committed `.wasm` fixture (Rust).
!
! `D=1` is set EXPLICITLY: the swing-damping default differs between Rust's spec
! (dss_capi 0.14.5 `generator.pas:1006` `Dpu:=1.0`) and the r4133 oracle
! (`generator.pas:968` sets `D:=1.0` in the ctor but never `Dpu`, so
! `InitStateVars` recomputes `D:=Dpu*kVArating*1000/w0=0`). Pinning `D=1` makes
! both engines agree on the damping (that default IS a real dss_capi-vs-r4133
! divergence, recorded in STATUS §WASM-UM WM.3). The dyn deck gates the FULL
! NUMERIC surface (see wasm_usermodels.rs `gate_deck(.., numeric=true)` +
! `wasm_gen_dyn_step1_trajectory_matches_oracle`): with D matched, the whole
! 21-step trajectory now matches BOTH the pinned 0.14.5 spec AND r4133 (which
! agree to ≤1e-13) at the faer-vs-KLU floors. The former ~5e-4 gap was a PROVEN
! Rust PORT bug in the dynamics-entry seed (FInit fed the converged V_n instead of
! the stale power-flow V_{n-1}); fixed in `user_model.rs::user_model_finit`
! (STATUS §"D2 sub-bug #2 — FIXED").
Clear
Set DefaultBaseFrequency=60
New Circuit.wasm_gen basekv=13.8 phases=3 bus1=sourcebus pu=1.00 R1=0.05 X1=0.15 R0=0.05 X0=0.15
New Line.feeder phases=3 bus1=sourcebus bus2=b3 length=1 units=km r1=0.1 x1=0.3 r0=0.3 x0=0.9 c1=0 c0=0
New Generator.g1 bus1=b3 phases=3 conn=delta kv=13.8 kW=4000 kVA=5000 Xdp=.27 Xdpp=0.2 H=1 pf=1 D=1 model=6 Balanced=No UserModel=@FIXTURE@ UserData=(Rs=0.0053 Xs=0.106 Rr=0.007 Xr=0.12 Xm=4 MaxSlip=0.1) ShaftModel=@FIXTURE@ ShaftData=(Rs=0.0053 Xs=0.106 Rr=0.007 Xr=0.12 Xm=4 MaxSlip=0.1)
New Monitor.mvi element=Generator.g1 terminal=1 mode=1
New Monitor.mvars element=Generator.g1 terminal=1 mode=3
Set voltagebases=[13.8]
CalcVoltageBases
Set Maxiterations=20
Solve
Set mode=dynamics number=1 h=0.000166667
Solve
Solve number=20
